{
  "id": 8859717763271,
  "title": "Personalized Bigfoot Campfire Night Forest Quilt Sets - Bigfoot 14",
  "handle": "personalized-bigfoot-campfire-night-forest-quilt-sets-bigfoot-14",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the mystery of the wild with the Jeminise Bigfoot Quilt Set, designed for adventure lovers and nature enthusiasts. Crafted from a soft blend of cotton and polyester, this quilt offers warmth, comfort, and style, perfect for adding a unique touch to your bedroom or for cozy nights in.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Bigfoot Design:</strong> Features a bold and playful Bigfoot design, perfect for nature lovers and outdoor adventurers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Quality Material:</strong> Made from a soft, durable blend of cotton and polyester for a cozy and breathable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile &amp; Functional:</strong> Ideal for year-round comfort as a warm blanket or a stylish decorative bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit every bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric ensures long-lasting use and easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Built to Last:</strong> Designed with high-quality stitching and vibrant, fade-resistant prints for durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A perfect gift for Bigfoot enthusiasts, campers, or anyone who loves the great outdoors.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Bigfoot Say Hi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Rodeo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) + (Optional) Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern Themed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
